</strong> WiFi, Bluetooth, USB-C<br data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"895\"><strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"911\">Controllers:</strong> Motion controllers<br data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"933\"><strong data-start=\"933\" data-end=\"943\">Kleur:</strong> Wit / White<br data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"958\"><strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"968\">Staat:</strong> Nieuw In Seal</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1055\">📦 <strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1004\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1007\">Meta Quest 3 VR-headset<br data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1033\">2 Motion controllers</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1116\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1061\" data-end=\"1079\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\">Incl. Garantie: 6 maanden garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
